From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SEGURIDAD-PORTES-33 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 11:45:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] v8: pending: a0f2c9f8c3 (M159 merge 27e138a575, crbug
 585625642)

TurboFan fix from V8 main, merged to 15.9 (M159) and not yet to 15.6:
keep the control input on non-cell context loads, stores and
context-extension checks so they cannot be scheduled before a
generator's SwitchOnGeneratorState. Same diff as upstream; the
context-specialization test hunks go to the 15.6 cctest. Waits for
the next release; the cache epoch is not bumped here. V8 gitlink
unchanged.
